{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command '$m = Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8 \"C:'\"\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.codex\\\\memories\\\\MEMORY.md\\\"; \"'$lines = $m -split \"`n\"; $start = 170; $end = [Math]::Min(215, $lines.Length); for ($i=$start; $i -lt $end; $i++) { \"{0}: {1}\" -f ($i+1), $lines[$i] }'","aggregated_output":"171: ## Reusable knowledge\r\n172: \r\n173: - V2.2.7 Visual Test discipline: run `story_validate.py bootstrap ... --no-write-report` and `story_visual_authority.py check` first; then persist a fresh `VT_...` with `story_test.py visual`, call the image service once, save to that run’s raw target, and only then `visual-finalize`. `latest.json` is navigation, not a gate; old V2.2.5 plans neither satisfy nor block append-only V2.2.7. [Task 1]\r\n174: - If gpt-image-2 returns a 3:2 landscape despite a 4:5 request and `canvas_normalize` says `source aspect too far from target for safe normalization`, deterministically center-crop the same image to target ratio and finalize it; do not make a second generation call. [Task 1]\r\n175: - For an upstream `http 502 Bad Gateway` / `upstream_server_error` under “只生成 1 张”, do not retry or switch model/CLI. Record `GENERATION_FAILED`, `real_image_created=false`, and the actual generation seconds with `visual-record-failure`; if generation was mistakenly invoked before a run existed, immediately create/bind the run and explicitly record that sequence. [Task 1]\r\n176: - Photography OS evidence lives at `episodes/10_彼此的天上/01_不存在的夜行路/meta/tests/photography-os/PT_.../`; runs carry contracts, frame prompts, generation/normalize/report JSON, and `regression-report.md`, while media is gitignored. The capture grammar is `FIRST_PERSON_CASUAL_SNAPSHOT_V1`; P01 is the fixed boyfriend/narrator for this episode and target is 1080×1350. [Task 2]\r\n177: - Round 2 recommendation was `CONDITIONAL_YES` for 01-20: first manually check frame 10 cart-push readability and record the frame 08 girlfriend-phone second-source attribution in the Storyboard. [Task 2]\r\n178: - V2.2.8 R2 adds primary-photographer/no-Ghost-Camera rules, Moment+Save Reason, natural time progression, physically coherent screen/UI content, and an 11-question review. The recorded verification was `python -m py_compile ...` plus `python episodes/_system/test_capture_grammar_v228.py`, yielding `CAPTURE GRAMMAR V2.2.8 SELF-TEST PASS` and `STORY OS V2.2.8 R2 LOCAL-SAFE INTEGRATION SELF-TEST PASS`; `a38f623` was pushed to `story`. [Task 3]\r\n179: \r\n180: ## Failures and how to do differently\r\n181: \r\n182: - Symptom: calling image_gen before persisting `VT_...` leaves `latest.json` bound to an earlier run after failure. Cause: run-binding order was skipped. Fix: persist before every image invocation; if already missed, backfill only an honest failure record, never a success/path. [Task 1]\r\n183: - Symptom: generated Frame 04 shows the taking phone’s camera UI, or historical Frame 10 becomes a modern SUV. Cause: physically impossible/self-screen or modern-default imagery was not explicit enough. Fix: require “手机背面朝向镜头，仅见摄像头模组” plus `camera_capture_ui`/`phone_screen_visible_to_viewer` forbiddens; require “木制驮货板车 + 火把照明” plus `modern_vehicle`. [Task 2]\r\n184: - Symptom: a dark frame passes contract checks but action readability is uncertain. Fix: stop at conditional recommendation and require human review; if needed, brighten with more torch/fire rather than asserting pass. [Task 2]\r\n185: - Symptom: an `ohmyphoto` worktree is deleted or empty. Fix: `git restore .` can restore tracked documents/state from the local commit, but it cannot restore ignored local media; treat any cleanup/move of that worktree as media-loss risk. [Task 3]\r\n186: \r\n187: # Task Group: aigc-dali-cat / Story OS V2.1 image_continue, Visual Lock, and production-progress reporting\r\n188: scope: Take over a preproduction-locked episode through `image_continue`, bind Visual Lock candidates with auditable user exceptions, and report honest production progress; do not silently cross handoff or visual-evidence gates.\r\n189: applies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat; reuse_rule=Story OS V2.1 scripts and the specific episode state are checkout-sensitive; reuse the authority order, state-machine rules, and Windows/Codex failure shields after rechecking current repository contracts.\r\n190: \r\n191: ## Task 1: Verify and activate preproduction handoff for 《停电夜蜕壳》\r\n192: \r\n193: ### rollout_summary_files\r\n194: \r\n195: - rollout_summaries/2026-08-31T10-37-05-MHK5-aigc_dali_cat_11_01_tingdian_yetuke_visual_lock_image_contin.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\31\\rollout-2026-08-31T18-37-05-01a05764-e6d4-7ce2-b8ce-828be30aa765.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-31T14:39:55+00:00, thread_id=01a05764-e6d4-7ce2-b8ce-828be30aa765, partial: handoff and four-frame binding completed; Visual Lock remains blocked by evidence/runtime gates)\r\n196: \r\n197: ### keywords\r\n198: \r\n199: - preproduction_handoff.py, preproduction-handoff.json, image_continue, HANDOFF_SHA_MISMATCH, stable_preproduction_subset, runtime-request.json, STORYBOARD_LOCKED\r\n200: \r\n201: ## Task 2: Direct user-exception acceptance and four-frame Visual Lock binding\r\n202: \r\n203: ### rollout_summary_files\r\n204: \r\n205: - rollout_summaries/2026-08-31T10-37-05-MHK5-aigc_dali_cat_11_01_tingdian_yetuke_visual_lock_image_contin.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\31\\rollout-2026-08-31T18-37-05-01a05764-e6d4-7ce2-b8ce-828be30aa765.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-31T14:39:55+00:00, thread_id=01a05764-e6d4-7ce2-b8ce-828be30aa765, success: frames 01/05/08/17 bound with explicit acceptance audit)\r\n206: \r\n207: ### keywords\r\n208: \r\n209: - visual_lock_v21.py, production_ledger.py, accept-user-exception-candidate, restore-evidence-gap-review, NEEDS_USER, scout_repair, direct_user_review_exception_acceptance, four_admission_v21, 01, 05, 08, 17\r\n210: \r\n211: ## Task 3: Windows Codex unified Visual Lock Critic diagnosis\r\n212: \r\n213: ### rollout_summary_files\r\n214: \r\n215: - rollout_summaries/2026-08-31T10-37-05-MHK5-aigc_dali_cat_11_01_tingdian_yetuke_visual_lock_image_contin.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\31\\rollout-2026-08-31T18-37-05-01a05764-e6d4-7ce2-b8ce-828be30aa765.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-31T14:39:55+00:00, thread_id=01a05764-e6d4-7ce2-b8ce-828be30aa765, partial: encoding/path fixes work, but independent worker cannot read image inputs)\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
